{"seq":1,"slug":"build-vs-buy-framework","title":"自建与采购的决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/build-vs-buy-framework","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"自建与采购的决策框架\">自建与采购的决策框架</h1><p>把「自建还是采购」当成一道二选一的意识形态题，是 2026 年企业 AI 落地里最贵的错误。真正的问题从来不是「我们能不能自己训一个模型」，而是「这块能力是不是我们的护城河，值不值得我们承担它的全生命周期成本」。KPMG 2026 年的决策框架给了一条很硬的经验线：当现成厂商方案能覆盖 80% 以上的需求时，应当直接买；覆盖率低于 60% 时，为弥合差距付出的定制成本往往超过从零自建（<a href=\"https://www.clickittech.com/ai/build-vs-buy-ai/\">KPMG via clickittech</a>）。本文给出一套可量化的框架，把战略差异化、TCO 拐点、锁定风险三件事拆开算清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-买重核心-建差异-用-ai-粘合\">核心概念：买重核心、建差异、用 AI 粘合</h2><p>2026 年大多数企业的结论是「两者都要」：买下沉重的核心（基础模型、向量库、推理平台），自建真正能形成差异的那一层，再用 AI 加速中间的胶水代码（<a href=\"https://hatchworks.com/blog/gen-ai/build-vs-buy-framework/\">hatchworks</a>）。判断「该不该自建」的第一性问题只有一个——这块能力是否构成可持续的竞争壁垒。只有当方案依赖任何厂商都复制不了的专有数据、或受严格数据驻留/合规约束、或规模大到 TCO 反转时，自建才划算（<a href=\"https://www.techment.com/blogs/build-vs-buy-ai-2026-enterprise-strategy/\">techment</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[新 AI 能力需求] --&gt; B{是否构成&lt;br/&gt;战略差异化护城河?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[采购:&lt;br/&gt;现成 API 或 SaaS]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{是否依赖专有数据&lt;br/&gt;或硬合规约束?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| C&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E{厂商方案&lt;br/&gt;需求覆盖率?}&#10;    E --&gt;|大于 80%| C&#10;    E --&gt;|60% 到 80%| F[混合:&lt;br/&gt;买核心 + 建差异层]&#10;    E --&gt;|小于 60%| G{规模是否越过&lt;br/&gt;TCO 拐点?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| F&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[自建:&lt;br/&gt;自托管 + 微调]\">flowchart TD\n    A[新 AI 能力需求] --&gt; B{是否构成&lt;br/&gt;战略差异化护城河?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[采购:&lt;br/&gt;现成 API 或 SaaS]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{是否依赖专有数据&lt;br/&gt;或硬合规约束?}\n    D --&gt;|否| C\n    D --&gt;|是| E{厂商方案&lt;br/&gt;需求覆盖率?}\n    E --&gt;|大于 80%| C\n    E --&gt;|60% 到 80%| F[混合:&lt;br/&gt;买核心 + 建差异层]\n    E --&gt;|小于 60%| G{规模是否越过&lt;br/&gt;TCO 拐点?}\n    G --&gt;|否| F\n    G --&gt;|是| H[自建:&lt;br/&gt;自托管 + 微调]</pre><p>下表把三种典型路径的成本结构、上线速度与锁定风险并列，便于快速定位自己所处的象限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>采购（API/SaaS）</th>\n<th>混合架构</th>\n<th>自建（自托管 + 微调）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前期投入</td>\n<td>近乎为零</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高（GPU + 团队）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位成本随规模</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>基线固定 + 溢出按量</td>\n<td>摊薄后边际极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上线速度</td>\n<td>数天</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n<td>数月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁定风险</td>\n<td>高（厂商定价/弃用）</td>\n<td>中（可切换路由）</td>\n<td>低（自控权重）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配规模</td>\n<td>小于 500 万 token/天</td>\n<td>波动负载</td>\n<td>大于 5 亿 token/月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来源：<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://www.justthink.ai/blog/build-vs-buy-enterprise-ai-2026\">justthink.ai</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采购侧的真实价码-2026-年-api-定价\">采购侧的真实价码：2026 年 API 定价</h2><p>把「买」这条路算清楚，前提是知道当下的牌价。2026 年中旬主流模型的每百万 token 价格（输入/输出）大致如下：OpenAI GPT-5.4 为 $2.50/$15，旗舰 GPT-5.4 Pro 为 $30/$180；Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6 作为生产主力为 $3/$15，Opus 4.7 为 $5/$25，Haiku 4.5 为 $1/$5；Google Gemini 3.1 Pro 为 $2/$12，Flash-Lite 低至 $0.10/$0.40（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">cloudzero</a>、<a href=\"https://www.aimagicx.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026\">aimagicx</a>）。</p>\n<p>牌价之外有两个常被忽略的折扣杠杆，它们会显著改变「买」的实际成本：Anthropic 的提示缓存可对静态系统提示打到九折，对带大段固定上下文的应用经常让 Claude 实际更便宜；OpenAI 的批处理对非实时任务直接腰斩 50%（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">cloudzero</a>）。一个月度 API 账单的估算可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{api}} = N_{\\text{req}} \\cdot (t_{\\text{in}} \\cdot p_{\\text{in}} + t_{\\text{out}} \\cdot p_{\\text{out}}) \\cdot (1 - d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{req}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是月请求量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{in}}, t_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单请求输入/输出 token 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{in}}, p_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为缓存或批处理折扣率。先把这个数算实，再去和自建对比，否则 TCO 拐点无从谈起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tco-拐点-什么时候自建才省钱\">TCO 拐点：什么时候自建才省钱</h2><p>「自建省钱」这句话只在越过某个体量后才成立。2026 年的多份测算把交叉点放在每天 1000 万到 3000 万 token 之间，或换算成月 API 支出的 5 万到 20 万美元区间——具体落点取决于模型大小、基础设施选型与真实的输入输出比（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>）。一个被反复引用的具体例子：一家每天处理 5000 万 token 的中型 SaaS，跑商用 API 月成本约 $18,750；而把量化后的 Llama 4 部署在两台预留 H100 实例上、再加 0.5 个 DevOps 人力，月成本仅 $10,200 到 $12,200（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>要小心「下载权重就等于省钱」的错觉：下载的模型权重只占总部署成本的约 2% 到 5%，其余都是 GPU、运维、可观测性与合规（<a href=\"https://aisuperior.com/open-source-llm-cost/\">aisuperior</a>）。最小化自托管的 TCO 起步就在每年约 12.5 万美元，企业级实现可超 1200 万美元（<a href=\"https://aisuperior.com/open-source-llm-cost/\">aisuperior</a>）。把自建月成本拆成固定与边际两部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>self</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>marginal</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{self}} = C_{\\text{gpu}} + C_{\\text{ops}} + N_{\\text{tok}} \\cdot c_{\\text{marginal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">self</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tok</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">marginal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>self</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{self}} = C_{\\text{api}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">self</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 解出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{tok}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tok</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是你的拐点 token 量。低于它，按量付费的 API 几乎总是更优；高于它（尤其月 5 亿 token 以上的高频应用），自托管几乎总是赢（<a href=\"https://devtk.ai/en/blog/self-hosting-llm-vs-api-cost-2026/\">devtk.ai</a>）。值得注意的是，开放权重模型在 2026 年初已能在多数评测上追平或超越上一代专有模型，最好开源与最好专有之间的差距从 2023 年的 20 到 30 个百分点收窄到 5 到 10 个百分点（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>），这让自建一侧的「质量代价」大幅下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微调-roi-放在自建决策的下游来算\">微调 ROI：放在自建决策的下游来算</h2><p>决定自建之后，「要不要微调」是紧接着的子决策，而它本身也遵循一条由便宜到贵的阶梯。2026 年最稳的排序是：先榨干提示工程，撞到知识墙再上 RAG，生产数据暴露出行为崩坏点时才叠加微调，量大到一定程度再做蒸馏（<a href=\"https://dev.to/muzammil_endevsols/rag-vs-fine-tuning-vs-prompting-2026-strategic-guide-169l\">dev.to</a>）。ROI 最高的微调形态，是在强基座上挂一个薄薄的 LoRA/QLoRA 适配器，并与检索配合而非取代检索（<a href=\"https://dev.to/muzammil_endevsols/rag-vs-fine-tuning-vs-prompting-2026-strategic-guide-169l\">dev.to</a>）。</p>\n<p>什么时候微调真的回本？当你需要提示无法稳定约束的一致行为、品牌口吻或非标准结构化输出；当延迟预算容不下检索那一跳；当体量大到让一个微调过的小模型比前沿 API 便宜一个数量级；或当所需信息本身是稳定的（<a href=\"https://www.scalacode.com/blog/rag-vs-fine-tuning/\">scalacode</a>）。反之，信息量大、动态、需要引用溯源做合规审计、缺标注数据、或追求最快上线时，选 RAG——一套生产级 RAG 的月成本约在 $350 到 $2,850 之间，2026 年 Q1 随嵌入模型降价 30% 还在继续下探（<a href=\"https://www.scalacode.com/blog/rag-vs-fine-tuning/\">scalacode</a>）。正确的提问不是「微调还是 RAG」，而是哪种混合能在成本/查询、成本/更新、延迟、质量这四个向量上把 TCO 压到最低（<a href=\"https://www.scalacode.com/blog/rag-vs-fine-tuning/\">scalacode</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁定风险与可逆性-把可切换性算进决策\">锁定风险与可逆性：把可切换性算进决策</h2><p>价格算平之后，决策的最后一层是「错了能不能回头」。2026 年的合规法规仍在演化，数据隐私与治理要求趋严，厂商锁定成为与成本同权重的决策因子（<a href=\"https://www.clickittech.com/ai/build-vs-buy-ai/\">clickittech</a>）。缓解锁定的主流做法是构建「模块化 AI 栈」——把模型作为可替换组件，技术一进步就能换掉，从而降低被单一厂商定价或弃用所绑架的风险（<a href=\"https://www.techment.com/blogs/build-vs-buy-ai-2026-enterprise-strategy/\">techment</a>）。</p>\n<p>这正是混合架构在 2026 年成为默认答案的原因：用本地基础设施承接可预测的基线吞吐，把溢出与前沿模型请求路由到云 API，既拿到自托管在基线上的成本效率，又保留云端面对尖峰的弹性（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>）。把切换成本显式纳入比较：一个被厂商专有微调格式深度绑定的方案，看起来当下便宜，但它的隐含负债是「换厂商时全部重训」。决策时应当问的不止是「现在哪个便宜」，而是「定价或质量变天时，我多快、多省地能换掉它」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>决策起点是战略差异化，不是技术能不能做到：能力非护城河、不依赖专有数据、厂商覆盖率超 80% 时，默认采购（<a href=\"https://www.clickittech.com/ai/build-vs-buy-ai/\">KPMG via clickittech</a>）。</li>\n<li>算清「买」的真实价码：2026 年 GPT-5.4 $2.50/$15、Claude Sonnet 4.6 $3/$15、Gemini 3.1 Pro $2/$12，再叠加缓存九折与批处理腰斩两个折扣杠杆（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison/\">cloudzero</a>）。</li>\n<li>TCO 拐点约在每天 1000 万到 3000 万 token、或月 5 万到 20 万美元 API 支出；权重只占总成本 2% 到 5%，别被「下载即省钱」误导（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/local-llms-vs-cloud-api-cost-analysis-2026/\">SitePoint TCO 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://aisuperior.com/open-source-llm-cost/\">aisuperior</a>）。</li>\n<li>微调是自建的下游子决策：按提示 → RAG → 微调 → 蒸馏的阶梯走，最高 ROI 形态是 LoRA/QLoRA 薄适配器配检索（<a href=\"https://dev.to/muzammil_endevsols/rag-vs-fine-tuning-vs-prompting-2026-strategic-guide-169l\">dev.to</a>）。</li>\n<li>把可逆性算进决策：用模块化栈与混合架构降低厂商锁定，问「换掉它多快多省」而非只问「现在哪个便宜」（<a href=\"https://www.techment.com/blogs/build-vs-buy-ai-2026-enterprise-strategy/\">techment</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自建与采购的决策框架","id":"自建与采购的决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：买重核心、建差异、用 AI 粘合","id":"核心概念-买重核心-建差异-用-ai-粘合"},{"level":2,"text":"采购侧的真实价码：2026 年 API 定价","id":"采购侧的真实价码-2026-年-api-定价"},{"level":2,"text":"TCO 拐点：什么时候自建才省钱","id":"tco-拐点-什么时候自建才省钱"},{"level":2,"text":"微调 ROI：放在自建决策的下游来算","id":"微调-roi-放在自建决策的下游来算"},{"level":2,"text":"锁定风险与可逆性：把可切换性算进决策","id":"锁定风险与可逆性-把可切换性算进决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引与检索的成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/indexing-and-retrieval-cost"},"next":{"title":"微调的 ROI 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/finetuning-roi-model"}}